  "notes": "From obvpm's joint refine (chanon/comfyui-obvpm-timeline, docs/h3.md). The latent upscaler must chunk along time: upscaled whole, it normalises every frame against the entire video and the refine hallucinates on the drift. Memory is one window's worth; the weights stream from RAM beside it."
